      "description": "Watch Amed vs Trabzonspor highlights and goals from Süper Lig on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 31, 2026. The Süper Lig encounter on August 31, 2026 , between Amed and Trabzonspor proved to be an intense tactical battle from the opening whistle. Both squads fought for control in a match characterized by physical challenges and shifting momentum. Early Pressure and First-Half Twists Trabzonspor started the match with clear intent, looking to dictate the tempo early on. Their efforts were rewarded in the 11th minute when Ernest Muci provided a clinical assist for Mohamed Salah , who found the back of the net to give the visitors an early lead. The game soon became a heated affair, with the referee issuing yellow cards to Sidny Lopes Cabral and Chibuike Nwaiwu as the first half progressed. The drama reached its peak just before the interval; Mbaye Diagne had a golden opportunity to equalize from the penalty spot but failed to convert. However, the home side's disappointment was short-lived as Collins Sor struck in the 5th minute of added time, ensuring both teams went into the break on level terms. Substitutions and the Final Countdown The second half saw both managers turning to their benches to find a breakthrough. Gift Orban was introduced early for the goalscorer Collins Sor , while Amed continued to show resilience despite a flurry of yellow cards for players like Samuel Ballet , Umut Meras , and Furkan Soyalp . The match seemed destined for a draw as tactical substitutions from both sides, including the introduction of Ozan Tufan and Amadou Cisse , failed to break the deadlock immediately. The physical nature of the contest remained high, with both teams struggling to find space in the final third. In the 90th minute, the stadium erupted when Mehmet Yesil set up Gift Orban for a dramatic late goal, completing the turnaround for Amed . The closing moments were chaotic, with Gift Orban picking up a yellow card during 